<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 13 bln SKR 7-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 13 bln SKR 7-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of 13 billion crowns of seven-day Treasury bills.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on April 16 with the paper maturing on April 23.</p>
<p>Bids are due by 0900 GMT on April 15 with the lowest accepted bid 100 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
